<section>
  <div class="wrap two two--top">
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><div><strong>Inquiry</strong><p>Fill in the short form on the <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact page</a>, or call. Tell us your child's age and what you are looking for. We reply with the practical things: programs, calendar, fees.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Meet and tour</strong><p>Come to the campus, meet the teachers, see a class in action. If you are not in Hội An yet, we do this on a video call. We will also chat with your child to understand how they learn and where their English is.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Trial days and forms</strong><p>If you like, your child can spend up to three days with us first. When you are ready, we send the enrollment packet. It asks for what we need to get the first day right: medical details, allergies, and who is allowed to collect your child.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Payment and welcome</strong><p>Pay the one-time admission fee and the first tuition payment. You get a welcome email with everything for day one, an invitation to your child's Google Classroom, and we add a name to a class list.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--green has-sticker"><span class="sticker sticker--green sticker--tr">Rolling admissions</span>{% photo "primary-students-clay-modelling", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}</div>
