</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>Before you ask</h2>
    <details><summary>What documents do you need?</summary><p>The completed enrollment form, passport copies for your child and for the parents, and your child's most recent school report. If your child has a diagnosis or a learning support plan, please bring a copy so we can plan for it.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Will my child do an assessment?</summary><p>Not a test. Before your child joins, our academic team meets them, usually during your visit, to see where their English and their schoolwork are. With younger children this happens through games and stories. Then we recommend the class that fits.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How much English does my child need?</summary><p>Your child does not need fluent English. In Early Years and Primary, children with little English usually settle in quickly. In Secondary, a basic level makes the Cambridge classes much easier to follow. For the Global Program's academic and full-day pathways we decide case by case.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can we do a trial day?</summary><p>Yes, up to three. A trial day costs 1,600,000 VND, meals included, and if your child enrolls we take it off the tuition.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Are there deadlines, or can we join any time?</summary><p>You can join any time of year. If your child starts after the year has begun, tuition runs from their first day. Staying for a few weeks or months instead? That is the <a href="{{ '/learning/global-program/' | url }}">Global Program</a>.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

